{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act50side_level_act50side_07_end","storyGroup":"act50side","storySort":15,"storyDependence":"act50side_level_act50side_07_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TD-7","storyName":"为什么全是死脑筋？","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"宝巫迦试图与“雷之主”同归于尽，梓兰和空爆及时出现并制止了她。而后，月见夜和斑弥罗也赶到，“A6小队”再次集结。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act50side/level_act50side_07_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act50side_07","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":13,"next":15,"characters":["宝巫迦","梓兰","义经","政宗","“雷之主”","空爆","月见夜","斑弥罗"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_bg_71_g10_bottomruins.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tense_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_tense_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":8},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_purifymagic","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":9},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_light","x":"-9","y":"-67","layer":"1","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":12},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"2.5","id":13},{"type":"bgeffect","id":14},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"70","ystrength":"70","vibrato":"70","randomness":"95","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":15},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_smock","layer":"1","id":16},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_skillroar_normal","volume":"1","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2102_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":19},{"type":"bgeffect","id":20},{"type":"charslot","id":21},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_light","x":"-9","y":"-67","layer":"1","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"还差……一点。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"bgeffect","id":25},{"type":"charslot","id":26},{"type":"text","text":"她正在用自己的力量与“雷之主”对抗，双方互不相让。","id":27},{"type":"text","text":"但是，这一点……就是咫尺天涯。","id":28},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_light","x":"-9","y":"-67","layer":"1","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"……身为巫女，身为国主，吾早就做好了准备。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"bgeffect","id":32},{"type":"charslot","id":33},{"type":"text","text":"为了弥补这最后一点的差距，只需要付出生命的代价就好了。","id":34},{"type":"text","text":"而对她来说，这永远是最微不足道的代价。","id":35},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_light","x":"-9","y":"-67","layer":"1","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"母亲，请保佑吾。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":39},{"type":"bgeffect","id":40},{"type":"text","text":"只要是为了泡影国，为了使命，为了责任……","id":41},{"type":"text","text":"即使不为了这些，哪怕只是为了让梓兰小姐和空爆小姐返回自己的家园。","id":42},{"type":"text","text":"这也是值得的。","id":43},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_light","x":"-9","y":"-67","layer":"1","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":45},{"type":"multiline","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾一定要……","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":47},{"type":"multiline","name":"宝巫迦","text":"杀死“雷之主”……","id":48},{"type":"charslot","id":49},{"type":"bgeffect","id":50},{"type":"text","text":"宝巫迦摘下眼罩，她的右眼开始闪烁起耀眼的光芒。","id":51},{"type":"text","text":"这是巫女代代相传的杀手锏，唯有在穷途末路之时才使用的招式。","id":52},{"type":"text","text":"主动使用它要消耗巨大的生命力，而稍有不慎，就有可能断送生命。","id":53},{"type":"text","text":"但反过来说，若是下定决心，则可以生命为代价，爆发巨大的能量。","id":54},{"type":"text","text":"能量在她的眼眶聚集，她感到视线开始模糊，以至于，她似乎看到了幻象——","id":55},{"type":"text","text":"她看到了两个不该出现的人，站在了她的面前。","id":56},{"type":"text","text":"她们不应该出现在这里的。","id":57},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"已经可以了，宝巫迦。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":61},{"type":"text","text":"梓兰握住宝巫迦的手，温柔地将她从浓雾之中拉了出来。","id":62},{"type":"text","text":"而空爆，也理所当然一般地将她护到了身后。","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"你们不该来的，这样做的话，吾就功亏一篑了！","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"l","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"……","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":69},{"type":"charslot","id":70},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_knockhead_cartoon","volume":"0.4","id":71},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.4","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":72},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"好痛……","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"dialog","id":79},{"type":"charslot","id":80},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":81},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_71_i07.png","fadetime":"0","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","id":82},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"15","block":"false","id":83},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":84},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$newhope02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_newhope02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":85,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":86},{"type":"text","text":"“雷之主”缓缓站起，它高大的身姿投下的阴影笼罩了几人。","id":87},{"type":"text","text":"但是，梓兰和空爆丝毫没有后退的意思。","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"……为什么？","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我和空爆的身边，确实有一个和你长得一模一样的孩子。","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"……你们长得很像，但是性格却完全相反。","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我把她——泡普卡当妹妹看待。她很胆小，也缺乏主见，如果没有人拉着她前进的话，她能在原地一个人待到大地毁灭。","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"但是，我只是她在罗德岛期间的队长，我无法一辈子当她的队长。","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"她总要学着自立。","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我并不想要求她一定要成为什么样的人……但她至少要学会去思考，自己想要成为什么样的人。","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"而你，你很独立自主，也有行动力，你知道自己想要什么。","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我确实有过一个念头——要是泡普卡能向你靠近一点就好了。","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"但我很快就打消了这个想法。因为宝巫迦是宝巫迦，泡普卡是泡普卡。","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"至少现在，我希望你能向她靠近一点——学会依靠别人一些。","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"你们……","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"下次，你再那样自顾自地走开，我可要更用力地敲你的头了。","id":101},{"type":"dialog","id":102},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":103},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":104},{"type":"dialog","id":105},{"type":"image","id":106},{"type":"charslot","id":107},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_bg_71_g10_bottomruins.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":108},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":109},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":110},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾……没错。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"就算你们不来，吾也可以完成自己的使命。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$2","focus":"l","id":118},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.4","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":119},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_knockhead_cartoon","volume":"1","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$2","focus":"l","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"哪有什么注定的使命。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":124},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice3","volume":"0.8","id":125},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（警惕的低吼）","id":127},{"type":"dialog","id":128},{"type":"charslot","id":129},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":130},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snarl_1","volume":"1","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2105_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2105_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.3","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":134},{"type":"charslot","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$5","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice3","volume":"1","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"梓兰，空爆，先带陛下撤离这里喵！","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"……不。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":141},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice2","volume":"1","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"为什喵？！","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你看“雷之主”——","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_skillroar_normal","volume":"1","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2102_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“雷之主”","text":"（极度愤怒的吼叫）","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2102_1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":149},{"type":"bgeffect","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":152},{"type":"charslot","id":153},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_normalpunch_roar","volume":"1","id":154},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":155},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_normalpunch_voice","volume":"1","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"0.01","id":157},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_normalpunch_echo","volume":"1","id":158},{"type":"delay","time":"0.01","id":159},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":161},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2105_1#1$1","id":163},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":164},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2105_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-20,-50","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":166},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":167},{"type":"charslot","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"它在帮我们？","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"它身上冒出的黑气少了许多……或许，和宝巫迦的战斗让它清醒了。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"对哦，如果它真的不是什么坏家伙，而且身上又有前代陛下的力量，它会觉得这些咒鬼才是真正的威胁好像也是正常的事。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$6","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice1","volume":"1","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"或许雷狼龙只是认为咒鬼的威胁比你们大喵！","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我没有天真到那个地步，但是，我们都听到了前代陛下的遗言。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"她说，不要对抗“雷之主”，要利用它的力量。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"……什么？！","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"这怎么可能！母亲有什么理由……","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"况且，就算是这样，“雷之主”伤害了月见夜，而且掀起了兽潮！","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":187},{"type":"dialog","id":188},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_steammachine_footstep","volume":"1","channel":"6","id":189},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"2.5","id":190},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2.5","xstrength":"70","ystrength":"70","vibrato":"70","randomness":"95","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":191},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"这个声音是——","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":195},{"type":"dialog","id":196},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","channel":"1","id":197},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"1.5","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":200},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":201},{"type":"charslot","id":202},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","channel":"2","id":203},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"2","fadetime":"1.5","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":206},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":207},{"type":"charslot","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"武士们？为什么你们会，难道——","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"陛下。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"月见夜，你没事吗？！","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"哼，这家伙哪里像没事的样子？","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"非要我用机器把他驮过来。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"陛下，我有千言万语想告诉您。但有一件事，眼下恐怕是最重要的。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"“雷之主”或许不是罪魁祸首。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":222},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":223},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":224},{"type":"charslot","id":225},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"false","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"你是说，“雷之主”救了你？！","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"没错。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"当时，我被爆炸波及，周围又有咒鬼靠近，我本以为必死无疑，“雷之主”却在此时出现，将咒鬼一扫而空。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"在那之后的事，我就不知道了。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"等等，难道我看到的，不是“雷之主”带着咒鬼把你击倒，是它救了你之后，在那里用巫女的力量净化那些咒鬼？！","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我恐怕……是这样的。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"等到醒来后，我得知陛下的去向，立刻就动身想来告诉您这件事。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"难道，母亲真的是将力量托付给了“雷之主”？","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"……但这样并非解释不通。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"如果说，“雷之主”本就不是“诅咒”的传播者，而是受害者……","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"如果说，母亲知道，“雷之主”一直在凭借本能捕食被“诅咒”感染的野兽……","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"而它之所以一直吸收“诅咒”也能活下来，是因为，母亲将力量给了它……","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"那么，吾等过去见到的“雷之主”，就不是灾难引发者，它只是受到灾难吸引，才会出现在那里……","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":249},{"type":"multiline","name":"宝巫迦","text":"真正的罪魁祸首……","id":250},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":251},{"type":"multiline","name":"宝巫迦","text":"是“诅咒”，或者说，是“御轮”？！","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"也就是说，“雷之主”至少不是我们的敌人？","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice3","volume":"0.8","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$5","focus":"m","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（警惕的低吼）","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":258},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice1","volume":"1","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"没错……咒鬼看起来也在向“御轮”靠近喵。","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"虽然不知道它们想干什么，但肯定不是什么好事喵……","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"无论如何，若要彻底启动“御轮”，吾的力量都是不够的，吾需要“雷之主”身上属于母亲的那一部分力量。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"那能不能让它帮我们的忙？","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"帮忙？","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"它只是野兽——","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"野兽也有本能，至少知道谁对自己威胁最大，不然也不会逮着咒鬼杀，对吧？","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"……有道理。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"就算它听不懂我们的话，只要它知道什么威胁最大，自然就是我们的帮手。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/af/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"也就是说，任务目标确定了，对吧，队长？","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"队长？","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"是啊。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":283},{"type":"text","text":"梓兰注意到，宝巫迦和月见夜也点了点头。","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你们一个是将军，一个是国主，看我干什么？","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾……虽然依然相信自己的做法没有错，但是，吾必须承认，你的方法或许更好。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"眼下，你能做出比吾更加正确的判断。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"如果没有梓兰小姐在我倒下后，替我指挥军队，泡影国此时已经一团乱麻，你留下的那封信，也给了我勇气。狩猎团全员，听你调遣。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"如果不是空爆的武器，我也开发不出这台“斑弥罗特制击龙枪”，你指哪儿，我打哪儿！","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"呃……原来那个东西真的有用啊！我还以为单纯逗我们玩的呢！","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"当然有！我说过多少次了，我可是正经的发明家！","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#5$2","focus":"m","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"那你至少改一改你命名的品味吧！","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"……","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"梓兰姐，下令吧。","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"真拿你们没办法。","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b4/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":307},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":308},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"那么，接下来由我来布置作战任务。","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":312},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":313},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":314},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":315},{"type":"dialog","id":316},{"type":"charslot","id":317},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":318},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$batmeeting_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_batmeeting_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":319,"musicid":2},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_71_i08.png","fadetime":"0","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","id":320},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"15","block":"false","id":321},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":322},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":323},{"type":"text","text":"群兽环伺，情况危急。","id":324},{"type":"text","text":"梓兰感觉自己的大脑前所未有地清晰。","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"任务的目标是接近“雷之主”。","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"但我们的目的不是狩猎它，而是帮助它彻底摆脱“诅咒”。","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"月见夜，你和你的手下作为先锋，打开道路。","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我明白了，定不辱命。","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"斑弥罗，你来配合月见夜。","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"怎么配合？","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"按你喜欢的方式炸个痛快。","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"哈！这个我喜欢！","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"空爆，你和我一起掩护宝巫迦。","id":334},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_creek","volume":"1","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"好嘞！","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"宝巫迦。","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾在。","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你的任务是——","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"不要留下遗憾。","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"……吾知道了。","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"这次任务十分危险，希望你们量力而行。","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"成功之后……请你们吃烤肉。","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"好寒酸啊，梓兰姐！","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"不满意就换个队长去吧。","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"那还是不要了，嘿嘿。","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"总觉得有一段时间没有凑到一起过了。","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"果然A6小队还得是这样才对劲嘛。","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"怎么感觉我和义经被排挤了喵！","id":349},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice1","volume":"0.8","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（不忿的喷气）","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"我也要吃烤肉喵！","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"行了行了，到时候让你来烤肉，满意了吧？","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"那还差不多喵！","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"出发吧。","id":355},{"type":"dialog","id":356},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":357},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"bgeffect","id":359},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":360},{"type":"image","id":361},{"type":"charslot","id":362}],"characters":["宝巫迦","梓兰","义经","政宗","“雷之主”","空爆","月见夜","斑弥罗"]}